{
  "name": "dsh-cache-control",
  "version": "1.4.1",
  "description": "会话策略四开关（设置页名称一律 2–4 字）：① 省缓存 —— 改写 standard agent preset 的 compaction-basic 参数（触发点 / 原文尾部保留百分比 / 自动压缩），只影响之后新建的会话；② 会话守则 —— 把插件内 session-gate.md 长期规则常驻注入 system prompt（R1 独立研判、R2 必要提问、R3 分工固定），对所有会话的下一个请求生效；③ 气泡置顶 —— 钉住「已越过会话区上沿的最后一条提问」（跟着滚动换条）、气泡宽度贴住文字、复制键落在气泡右侧轨道、底衬模糊度可调；④ 对话页 —— 固定会话列宽 640–3840px（原 dsh-bg-atelier「底图工坊 · 对话页」整节移入，启动时自动迁移旧值）。四项互相独立，chip 上前两项各自可点、后两项在设置页。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "compaction",
    "cache",
    "session-gate",
    "system-prompt",
    "chat-appearance"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "session-gate.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver": "^0.1.2-alpha.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Raylen-berry/dsh-cache-control.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Raylen-berry/dsh-cache-control/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Raylen-berry/dsh-cache-control#readme",
  "license": "MIT"
}
